---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="Shop information" description="How the shop works: buying one-of-a-kind pieces, shipping, care and returns.">
  <section class="container page-head narrow">
    <h1 class="page-title">Shop information</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="section container narrow" aria-label="Shop information">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>How the shop works</h2>
      <p>
        Every piece is one of a kind. Once it sells, it's gone. New work goes up on
        <a href={site.instagram.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a> first, then in the
        <a href="/shop/">shop</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Pieces with a Buy button can be bought straight away. Checkout is handled securely by Stripe.
        For anything marked "Ask about this piece", <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> and I'll
        reply with a price and shipping.
      </p>

      <h2>Shipping</h2>
      <p class="draft">
        Draft: say where you ship, how long it takes, what it costs, and how pieces are packed.
      </p>

      <h2>Care</h2>
      <p class="draft">
        Draft: for example, hand washing only, and that crystalline surfaces are decorative unless a
        piece's listing says its inside is lined with a food-safe glaze. Check this matches your glazes.
      </p>

      <h2>Returns</h2>
      <p class="draft">
        Draft: say whether you accept returns, and what happens if a piece arrives damaged.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Anything else, <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
